        {
          "id": "5b8f3a2",
          "elType": "widget",
          "settings": {
            "html": "<!-- ============================================================\n  Google-Buchungsseite – KOPF (Elementor HTML-Widget, oberstes Widget)\n  Darunter folgen die Kategorie-Karten (seiten-kategorien.html) und das Shortcode-Widget mit den Amelia-Popups.\n  Alle Klassen beginnen mit \"stg-\", damit nichts mit Theme/Kit kollidiert.\n  ============================================================ -->\n<style>\n  /* Seitenhintergrund (Elementor-Canvas-Seite hat sonst Weiß) */\n  body:has(.stg-page-marker){ background:#F7F1EA !important; }\n\n  .stg-w{ width:100%; max-width:760px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto; }\n\n\n  .stg-head{ text-align:center; padding:28px 4px 8px; }\n  .stg-head .stg-brand{\n    display:inline-block; text-decoration:none !important;\n    font-family:\"Playfair Display\",Georgia,serif !important;\n    font-size:22px; letter-spacing:.04em; color:#2E2A28 !important;\n  }\n  .stg-head .stg-kicker{\n    margin:4px 0 0 !important; font-size:11.5px; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase;\n    color:#7A7A7A !important;\n  }\n  .stg-head h1{\n    margin:26px 0 10px !important;\n    font-family:\"Playfair Display\",Georgia,serif !important;\n    font-weight:500 !important; font-size:clamp(28px,6vw,40px) !important; line-height:1.15 !important;\n    color:#2E2A28 !important;\n  }\n  .stg-head .stg-lead{\n    margin:0 auto !important; max-width:520px;\n    font-size:16px !important; line-height:1.6 !important; color:#4A4442 !important;\n  }\n  .stg-head .stg-addr{\n    margin:14px 0 0 !important; font-size:14px !important; color:#7A7A7A !important;\n  }\n  .stg-rule{ width:48px; height:2px; margin:22px auto 0; background:#C8B178; border:0; }\n</style>\n\n<span class=\"stg-page-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n<header class=\"stg-head\">\n  <a class=\"stg-brand\" href=\"https://spiritual-touch.de/\">Spiritual Touch</a>\n  <p class=\"stg-kicker\">Tantramassage &amp; Körpertherapie · München</p>\n\n  <h1>Termin online buchen</h1>\n  <p class=\"stg-lead\">\n    Wähle, was zu dir passt – Begleitung und Wunschtermin suchst du dir im nächsten Schritt aus.\n  </p>\n  <p class=\"stg-addr\">Olschewskibogen 12 · 80935 München-Feldmoching-Hasenbergl</p>\n  <hr class=\"stg-rule\">\n</header>\n",
            "_css_classes": "stg-w"
          },
          "elements": [],
          "widgetType": "html"
        },
        {
          "id": "e19a4d6",
          "elType": "widget",
          "settings": {
            "html": "<!-- ============================================================\n  Google-Buchungsseite – KATEGORIEN (Elementor HTML-Widget, zweites Widget)\n  Fünf Karten, Reihenfolge wie gewünscht: 2, 5, 3, 4, 6.\n  Jede Karte trägt eine eigene Klasse (st-kat-N); das Shortcode-Widget\n  darunter hängt pro Kategorie ein Amelia-Popup an genau diese Klasse.\n  Kategorien: 2 = Kennenlern-Gespräch, 5 = Zu Zweit, 3 = Angebote für Männer,\n              4 = Angebote für Frauen, 6 = Coaching & Begleitung\n  ============================================================ -->\n<style>\n  .stg-cats{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px; padding:20px 0 8px; }\n\n  .stg-cat{\n    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; width:100%;\n    text-align:left; cursor:pointer; font:inherit;\n    background:#fff !important; color:#2E2A28 !important;\n    border:1px solid rgba(91,67,56,.14) !important; border-radius:14px !important;\n    padding:16px 18px !important;\n    box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(46,42,40,.05);\n    transition:transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease, border-color .15s ease;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;\n  }\n  .stg-cat:hover, .stg-cat:focus-visible{\n    border-color:#C8B178 !important; transform:translateY(-1px);\n    box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(46,42,40,.09);\n    outline:none;\n  }\n  .stg-cat:active{ transform:none; filter:brightness(.98); }\n\n  .stg-cat-text{ flex:1 1 auto; min-width:0; }\n  .stg-cat-title{\n    display:block;\n    font-family:\"Playfair Display\",Georgia,serif; font-size:19px; line-height:1.25;\n    color:#2E2A28;\n  }\n  .stg-cat-sub{ display:block; margin-top:3px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.45; color:#7A7A7A; }\n  .stg-cat-chev{ flex:0 0 auto; color:#C8B178; }\n\n  /* erste Karte (Kennenlern-Gespräch) leicht abgesetzt: Gold-Hintergrund wie st-btn-primary */\n  .stg-cat.stg-cat-intro{\n    background:#FBF6E9 !important; border-color:#C8B178 !important;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"stg-cats\" aria-label=\"Angebot wählen\">\n\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"stg-cat stg-cat-intro st-kat-2\">\n    <span class=\"stg-cat-text\">\n      <span class=\"stg-cat-title\">Unsicher? Kostenloses Kennenlern-Gespräch</span>\n      <span class=\"stg-cat-sub\">Unverbindlich – wir lernen uns kurz kennen</span>\n    </span>\n    <svg class=\"stg-cat-chev\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 6l6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n  </button>\n\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"stg-cat st-kat-5\">\n    <span class=\"stg-cat-text\">\n      <span class=\"stg-cat-title\">Zu Zweit</span>\n      <span class=\"stg-cat-sub\">Für Paare und Rituale zu zweit oder zu dritt</span>\n    </span>\n    <svg class=\"stg-cat-chev\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 6l6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n  </button>\n\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"stg-cat st-kat-3\">\n    <span class=\"stg-cat-text\">\n      <span class=\"stg-cat-title\">Angebote für Männer</span>\n      <span class=\"stg-cat-sub\">Tantramassage, Bodyflow, Körperarbeit &amp; mehr</span>\n    </span>\n    <svg class=\"stg-cat-chev\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 6l6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n  </button>\n\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"stg-cat st-kat-4\">\n    <span class=\"stg-cat-text\">\n      <span class=\"stg-cat-title\">Angebote für Frauen</span>\n      <span class=\"stg-cat-sub\">Tantramassage, Bodyflow, Körperarbeit &amp; mehr</span>\n    </span>\n    <svg class=\"stg-cat-chev\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 6l6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n  </button>\n\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"stg-cat st-kat-6\">\n    <span class=\"stg-cat-text\">\n      <span class=\"stg-cat-title\">Coaching &amp; Begleitung</span>\n      <span class=\"stg-cat-sub\">Körperorientiertes Coaching einzeln oder zu zweit</span>\n    </span>\n    <svg class=\"stg-cat-chev\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 6l6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n  </button>\n\n</section>\n",
            "_css_classes": "stg-w"
          },
